# Cloudflare Pages — SPA fallback.
#
# Replaces nginx's `try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html` (nginx.conf:67), which
# still serves the homelab container. Without this, any deep link
# (/leren, /lesson/<id>, /checkout/success) 404s on a hard refresh, because
# only "/" exists as a real file — React Router owns every other path.
#
# Cloudflare serves a matching static file first and only falls through to this
# rule when none exists, so assets, fonts and the service worker are unaffected.
# Status 200 (not 302) so the URL the user sees is preserved and the router can
# read it — a redirect would rewrite the address bar and lose the route.
/*    /index.html   200
